OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start in Buchan and
OL,6,Fnortheast, otherwise cloudy with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain developing, this
OL,8,Flight and patchy over Moray and Banff
OL,9,Fbut heavier across southern
OL,10,FAberdeenshire, the hills will see some
OL,11,Fsnow. Windy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain continuing into the
OL,14,Fovernight, heavy at times for south
OL,15,FAberdeenshire, perhaps drier by dawn
OL,16,Ffor Aberdeen. Winds easing overnight
OL,17,Ftoo.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
