OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with further lighter
OL,6,Frain on Wednesday morning, rain
OL,7,Fturning patchy through the afternoon
OL,8,Fand evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,11,Fwith a few bright spells on Thursday
OL,12,Fbut winds strengthening. Further rain
OL,13,Fon Friday, wintry again over the
OL,14,Fhills. Turning brighter but cold again
OL,15,Flater on Friday and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
